description=Replaces the in-game world map and minimap with the painted Crater of Trade map (the same map as zomboid.wubcord.app), with the game's own street and place names on top. Printed and stash maps are unchanged. Also shows the Crater of Trade banner and badge for the server in the main-menu server browser (while the mod is enabled there). Each part can be toggled off in Options > Mods. Made for The Crater of Trade server - a Wubcord World.
